{"id":"kol7mugvjt12s75piqj50iprg","title":"FDA批准Zanvastro治疗Alexander病","originalTitle":"After 30 years, scientists finally have a drug for a deadly brain disease","summary":"FDA批准Zanvastro用于直接治疗Alexander病，这是针对该病潜在生物过程的疾病修饰治疗。Ionis Pharmaceuticals开展的国际临床试验覆盖13个临床中心并纳入54名患者，治疗一年多后，患者步行速度优于未接受药物者，运动功能总体得到稳定，部分患者有所改善。","reason":"文章串联了GFAP致病机制、ASO靶向策略与临床试验结果，呈现罕见病基础研究转化为治疗的完整路径。","source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 健康医学"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/10/261007042111.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-13T00:43:43.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-13T12:33:29.517Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-13T12:33:29.517Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["监管批准","FDA"],"score":85,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"f4ff4d76-5a69-4af0-bf11-85cff67acbbc","title":"FDA批准亚历山大病药物Zanvastro"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"f4ff4d76-5a69-4af0-bf11-85cff67acbbc","title":"FDA批准亚历山大病药物Zanvastro"}],"topics":[{"slug":"fda","name":"FDA"},{"slug":"regulatory-approval","name":"监管批准"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fZVaj3ePi3gU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}